  "shots": [
    {
      "id": "shot-01",
      "text": "怀孕第1周，宝宝还没开始长？这12周，你的身体正悄悄改变。",
      "phase": "写给刚怀孕的你",
      "screen_text": "写给刚怀孕的你",
      "start": 0,
      "frames": 127,
      "audio_start": 0.15,
      "audio_duration": 4.702040816326531,
      "audio": "runs/audio-v4-20261014-035958-d0af/audio/shot-01.wav",
      "sha256": "401b9e734dd7678e6131e9ee2fbe2c9a849a73899e2210caa2cff2416c072857",
      "production_frames": 141
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-02",
      "text": "孕周从你末次月经的第一天算起，不是从受精那天开始算。",
      "phase": "第1周",
      "screen_text": "第1周",
      "start": 127,
      "frames": 131,
      "audio_start": 5.441666666666667,
      "audio_duration": 4.887800453514739,
      "audio": "runs/audio-v4-20261014-035958-d0af/audio/shot-02.wav",
      "sha256": "ae8d12ae2d3f21611497d7ba8857b47f812d6f7f331e73b2ead69827dd9420ab",
      "production_frames": 141
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-03",
      "text": "第2周，身体在为排卵做准备。每个人的周期不同，排卵时间也会不同。",
      "phase": "第2周",
      "screen_text": "第2周",
      "start": 258,
      "frames": 140,
      "audio_start": 10.9,
      "audio_duration": 5.2477097505668935,
      "audio": "runs/audio-v4-20261014-035958-d0af/audio/shot-03.wav",
      "sha256": "e28888f33d1b30c76d880112f3efc0b925205d5b23fd90d0a9d376c76421c67a",
      "production_frames": 141
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-04",
      "text": "第3周前后，小蝌蚪可能与卵子相遇。受精卵一边分裂，一边向子宫移动。",
      "phase": "第3周",
      "screen_text": "第3周",
      "start": 398,
      "frames": 146,
      "audio_start": 16.73333333333333,
      "audio_duration": 5.50312925170068,
      "audio": "runs/audio-v4-20261014-035958-d0af/audio/shot-04.wav",
      "sha256": "57ae615fd252d1c07c712ba71f4d3035c15ccad2a104cf3a0494324e9341ff63",
      "production_frames": 158
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-05",
      "text": "第4周前后，受精卵通常已经着床。你也许还没什么感觉。",
      "phase": "第4周",
      "screen_text": "第4周",
      "start": 544,
      "frames": 130,
      "audio_start": 22.816666666666666,
      "audio_duration": 4.841360544217687,
      "audio": "runs/audio-v4-20261014-035958-d0af/audio/shot-05.wav",
      "sha256": "78409fbd20eface530e1df29265ac863d69bb7fdee9d569ae1c7a50bb57facd2",
      "production_frames": 141
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-06",
      "text": "第5周，宝宝的脑、脊髓和心脏正在发育。月经没来、总想睡，可能让你发现怀孕。",
      "phase": "第5周",
      "screen_text": "第5周",
      "start": 674,
      "frames": 174,
      "audio_start": 28.23333333333333,
      "audio_duration": 6.6873469387755105,
      "audio": "runs/audio-v4-20261014-035958-d0af/audio/shot-06.wav",
      "sha256": "32f05a8412e01b338801d37928c2e83dbc9e10ae1fad9c0bce8038137530d4d8",
      "production_frames": 175
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-07",
      "text": "第6周，宝宝的小胳膊、小腿开始长出雏形。你可能会反胃、想吐，不一定只在早上。",
      "phase": "第6周",
      "screen_text": "第6周",
      "start": 848,
      "frames": 180,
      "audio_start": 35.483333333333334,
      "audio_duration": 6.942766439909297,
      "audio": "runs/audio-v4-20261014-035958-d0af/audio/shot-07.wav",
      "sha256": "c3498c908c36b778d1d89cae641ab28b6b13f2c34dffeb95cc5a9d79475737b7",
      "production_frames": 192
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-08",
      "text": "第7周，宝宝的脑部和小胳膊继续发育。容易累的时候，就多休息一会儿。",
      "phase": "第7周",
      "screen_text": "第7周",
      "start": 1028,
      "frames": 149,
      "audio_start": 42.983333333333334,
      "audio_duration": 5.642448979591837,
      "audio": "runs/audio-v4-20261014-035958-d0af/audio/shot-08.wav",
      "sha256": "abe4e609a83b3f6d76d100ea32dc05fa4566195e176fabb7b089104263d0f045",
      "production_frames": 158
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-09",
      "text": "第8周，宝宝的手脚继续发育。如果闻到饭味就反胃，先选自己吃得下的食物。",
      "phase": "第8周",
      "screen_text": "第8周",
      "start": 1177,
      "frames": 157,
      "audio_start": 49.19166666666666,
      "audio_duration": 5.990748299319728,
      "audio": "runs/audio-v4-20261014-035958-d0af/audio/shot-09.wav",
      "sha256": "2b8c2f252f03849103973438ece2e010a4f136659a70a28f19f197706a08db0f",
      "production_frames": 158
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-10",
      "text": "第9周，宝宝的面部轮廓更清楚，手脚继续发育。孕吐和疲倦可能还没缓解。",
      "phase": "第9周",
      "screen_text": "第9周",
      "start": 1334,
      "frames": 155,
      "audio_start": 55.733333333333334,
      "audio_duration": 5.88625850340136,
      "audio": "runs/audio-v4-20261014-035958-d0af/audio/shot-10.wav",
      "sha256": "4f5d7a59ae07ba6c35742896be80057fa23719a0e30de9a6b2849d6a3033382f",
      "production_frames": 158
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-11",
      "text": "第10周，宝宝已经会做小动作了。不过，这时你通常还感觉不到胎动。",
      "phase": "第10周",
      "screen_text": "第10周",
      "start": 1489,
      "frames": 125,
      "audio_start": 62.19166666666666,
      "audio_duration": 4.632380952380952,
      "audio": "runs/audio-v4-20261014-035958-d0af/audio/shot-11.wav",
      "sha256": "60e7b0be0f3781ffc9fca91e10bcd293fe2a40ab446ef2855311e81d40a4cfce",
      "production_frames": 141
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-12",
      "text": "第11周，宝宝的小手指、脚趾逐渐分开，身体还在继续长大。",
      "phase": "第11周",
      "screen_text": "第11周",
      "start": 1614,
      "frames": 132,
      "audio_start": 67.4,
      "audio_duration": 4.911020408163266,
      "audio": "runs/audio-v4-20261014-035958-d0af/audio/shot-12.wav",
      "sha256": "8f452281c83176e5c9a437457eb79e3b7597f08bb103ef03c2b668be40b4cb5a",
      "production_frames": 141
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-13",
      "text": "第12周，宝宝从头顶到小屁股大约五厘米。器官还在发育，记得按医生安排产检。",
      "phase": "第12周",
      "screen_text": "第12周",
      "start": 1746,
      "frames": 170,
      "audio_start": 72.9,
      "audio_duration": 6.524807256235827,
      "audio": "runs/audio-v4-20261014-035958-d0af/audio/shot-13.wav",
      "sha256": "2a21d018a671123298800286ea95932b6ab71bbc949ca38e0fa2fda6a07b29dd",
      "production_frames": 175
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-14",
      "text": "陪伴，可以从小事开始：分担家务，准备她吃得下的饭菜，陪她去产检。",
      "phase": "把爱放进小事里",
      "screen_text": "把爱放进小事里",
      "start": 1916,
      "frames": 145,
      "audio_start": 79.98333333333333,
      "audio_duration": 5.468299319727891,
      "audio": "runs/audio-v4-repair-20261014-040800-4e44/audio/shot-14.wav",
      "sha256": "5bab00effb1f7669b9b8d19558e96c5cb6289dce8c485fdada49266f76ab101a",
      "production_frames": 158
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-15",
      "text": "每个人的感受都不同。如果出血、明显腹痛，或吐到喝不进水，记得及时就医。",
      "phase": "照顾好自己",
      "screen_text": "照顾好自己",
      "start": 2061,
      "frames": 153,
      "audio_start": 86.025,
      "audio_duration": 5.804988662131519,
      "audio": "runs/audio-v4-20261014-035958-d0af/audio/shot-15.wav",
      "sha256": "40e5603739322020691195ff5a6e644699ef28ec7d59d53d03810a866c18fea0",
      "production_frames": 158
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-16",
      "text": "肚子还没显出来，你也已经很辛苦了。收藏这份孕周记录，转给那个愿意好好照顾你的人。",
